{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26875","headline":"题郑驸马林亭 · 姚合","name":"题郑驸马林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东园连宅起，胜事与心期。\n幽洞自生药，新篁迸入池。\n密林行不尽，芳草坐难移。\n石翠疑无质，莺歌似有词。\n莎台高出树，藓壁净题诗。\n我独多来赏，九衢人不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}